        </div>
        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>MEAICON's OTA fleet management platform orchestrates signed application containers and firmware delivery to any field device — trucks, buses, cars, building gateways, and IoT endpoints. Every image is cryptographically signed with hardware-rooted keys and verified before execution, ensuring firmware authenticity even on a compromised communication channel. Staged rollout with automatic rollback on failure protects every deployment.</p>
          <p>The platform manages thousands of devices as easily as one — onboarding, authentication, configuration management, remote diagnostics, and secure de-provisioning across the full device lifecycle. Fleet-wide OTA delivers new AI models, security patches, and configuration changes overnight with zero physical intervention, while building gateways receive the same treatment as fleet vehicles.</p>
